{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんはー!(長いブログです)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日のランタンフェスティバルにて、長崎市観光大使に任命していただきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな長崎のことを私自身、勉強しながら沢山の魅力をお伝えしていけるようにしっかりと務めさせていただきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます。\n嬉しいです!!気合入ってます!!よろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKCZ9DAK4V7Z90JG9BV1NJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番好きな場所!水辺の森公園!(出島ポーズ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山写真撮ってきたので、ランタンに行った気分になって頂けたらいいな〜☺"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ランタンフェスティバルは中国の春節祭が起源となっているお祭りです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKD06H91Z8XXSYQJG91EDN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"眼鏡橋の上から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKD16QDWY35NWNCJGJK7NK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKD278EJ77FA91M9KZMY2H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKD37D9J0CPBQW6YPVXHAR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"